          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 148. Establish basket-weave panels across the first dc row. Continue in pattern for 81.7 cm. Shape neck at top of front. Seam shoulders."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sleeves (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 56. Work basket-weave in pattern, increasing each end every 4 rows to 146 sts. Total sleeve 63.3 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Seam sides. Set in sleeves. Work 3 rounds of dc around neck for a clean edge."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
